  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She is one of three rank seven Gu Immortals from Western Desert super forces clearing weakened dragon crocodiles with Shi Kang and Tuoba Feng Yan. She cultivates fire path. By the three clans’ agreement the immemorial dragon crocodile belongs to her. She opens her immortal aperture, takes the corpse in, and smiles that many dao marks are preserved, crediting Tuoba Feng Yan’s plan and later joining the modest credit exchange with Shi Kang.",
      "chapters": [
        2222
      ],
