      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_shi_kang",
        "char_tuoba_feng_yan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Asked about Wan clan leading an attack on Fang clan, she says Wan clan and Fang clan have deep grudges, so leading with a proper reason is not strange, but she thinks Wan clan’s decision will cause problems in the future. Tuoba Feng Yan holds the same view. She and Tuoba Feng Yan look to Shi Kang when arranging the next step of their trip, and they envy that after the hunt he can sell many dragon crocodiles in treasure yellow heaven without handing them to his clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2222
      ],
